  LocationName: RobCo Robotics - Upstairs
  SpeakerName: Narrator
  DialogueText: You head up a staircase that leads to the second floor of the building.
    Uppon reaching the top of the stairs you see a room with a small amount of furnature
    and corner of the room filled with rubble from the roof. Partially sticking out
    of the rubble lies a deactivated robot. You can make out a doorframe blocked
    by the collapsed roof. In the opposite corner of the room is a closed door.
